    condition: {fileID: 40303770}
  - id: piston
    title: GET THE HERO PAST THE PISTON
    hint: The hero won't walk into moving machinery. [Q] to FREEZE and freeze the piston while it is pulled back.
    condition: {fileID: 1255950880}
